    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 5bd3d9159c594c94a3c4d240b9f0ad8d
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A shield-bearer''s escort (any faction): while an ally of its own side with a Frontal Shield up is near, it keeps behind that bearer and a step to one side, firing past its shoulder, and follows it as it advances. Once the shield breaks or the bearer falls the behavior fails, so put it above the fight behaviors it should fall back to (cover, flanking). Pairs with a Bulwark.'
